                {
                  "label": "Note",
                  "value": "No scale shown. instead inset says: The inner parts of the urban area are highlighted according to their importance and kept correspondingly large for clarity. Colour lithograph map of Berlin on two pages. Advertisements bordering all four sides: Hotel Monopol-Metropole, Frankfurt a.M.; Kerkau-Palast, Berlin; Tattersall am Kurfürstendamm Aktiengesellschaft, Berlin; Klein-Flottbek bei Hamburg Haus I.Ranges, 100 Wohn- u. Schlafzimmer Parkhotel Teufelsbrücke (Translation: Klein-Flottbek near Hamburg House I.Ranges, 100 living and bedroom Parkhotel Teufelsbrücke) Inset has address and copyright warning. Legend shows: Long distance stations; Elevated stations; Elevated railways; Post offices; Schools; Stations for city and long distance traffic; Railways; Trams; Medical stations; Firestations; City transport stations; Underground stations; District boundaries; Postal district boundaries; and Theaters."
                },
